Corridor chain overrides (all 8 corridors now fully specified):
  - AR: USDT→Tron, USDC→Base
  - BR: USDT→Tron, USDC→Base
  - IN: USDT→Tron, USDC→Base
  - ID: USDT→Tron, USDC→Base
  - PH: USDT→Tron, USDC→Base
  - AE: USDT→Ethereum (institutional hub), USDC→Base
  - NG/VN: already correct (Tron/USDT, Ethereum/USDC)

Withdraw router (Agent Ledger API):
  - POST /v1/agent-accounts/{id}/withdraw — fiat/wallet withdrawal via v1 rails
  - 4 gates: KYA ≥ basic, corridor + beneficiary validation, available balance,
    corridor amount limits (min/max)
  - Reserves balance atomically; submits single-task batch to v1 Ingress API
  - On v1 failure: releases reservation + 503; no silent balance loss
  - Appends withdrawal_initiated ledger entry; returns withdrawal_id + v1_batch_id
  - WithdrawRequest + WithdrawResponse schemas in schemas.py
  - v1_ingress_api_url setting (renamed from v1_ingress_url)
  - Registered in main.py

Docker deployment:
  - Dockerfile for ingress-api (8000), agent-ledger (8100), ops-console (8200)
  - docker-compose.yml: full local dev stack — postgres, pubsub emulator,
    3 API services, 6 MCP servers; x-common-env anchor; named volumes;
    healthchecks; env passthrough from .env

GitHub Actions CI (.github/workflows/finogrid-ci.yml):
  - lint: ruff (E,W,F,I)
  - unit-tests: pytest with coverage + codecov upload
  - integration-tests: postgres service container + migration apply
  - docker-build: matrix build for all 3 service Dockerfiles
  - Triggers on push to master/claude/**/feature/** (finogrid/** paths)

Integration tests (3 flows):
  - Flow 1: corridor chain selection (all 8×2 combos), beneficiary validation
    (6 corridors), Bridge webhook signature + status mapping, KYT decision mapping
  - Flow 2: schema validation (withdraw, wallet, intent), mandate model enums,
    KYA validator internal backend, withdraw router guards (balance, corridor,
    min amount, v1 failure rollback), x402 header format
  - Flow 3: Plaid link token shape, ACH pull validation, webhook event mapping,
    transfer status credit decisions, intent sweeper expiry logic

